<<
/E (Privacy Act and Paperwork Reduction Act Notice\015We ask for the information on this form to carry out the Internal Revenue laws of the United States\056 We need it to ensure that preparers are complying with these laws and to allow us to figure and collect the right amount of tax\056\015\015You are not required to provide the information requested on a form that is subject to the Paperwork Reduction Act unless the form displays a valid OMB control number\056 Books or records relating to a form or its instructions must be retained as long as their contents may become material in the adminis\055tration of any Internal Revenue law\056 Generally\054 tax returns and return information are confidential\054 as required by Internal Revenue Code section 6103\056\015\015The time require to complete this form will vary depending on individual circumstances\056 The estimated average time is 15 minutes\056 The primary purpose of this form is to report potential violations of the Internal Revenue laws by tax return preparers\056 We are requesting this information under authority of 26 U\056S\056C\056 \247 7801 and \247 7803\056 Providing this information is voluntary\054 and failure to provide all or part of the information will not affect you\056 Providing false or fraudulent information may subject you to penalties\056 We may disclose this information to the Department of Justice to enforce the tax laws\054 both civil and criminal\054 and to cities\054 states\054 the District of Columbia\054 and U\056S\056 commonwealths or possessions to carry out their tax laws\056 We may also disclose this information to other countries under a tax treaty\054 to federal and state agencies to enforce federal non\055tax criminal laws\054 and to federal law enforcement and intelligence agencies to combat terrorism\056)
/K 93
/P 416 0 R
/Pg 105 0 R
/S /P
>>
